    "category": "Non-automatic weighing instrument",
    "type_designations": ["LI-700"],
    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "Non-automatic weighing instrument designated LI-700, operating as a weight or weight/price labeller. Comprises a self-indicating and price-computing weighing machine with associated thermal label printer. Devices: initial zero-setting device, semi-automatic zero-setting device, zero-tracking device, preset tare device, semi-automatic tare device (subtractive), zero indication, price computation; calibration not accessible to user. Interfaces: USB, Serial (RS232), Ethernet. Legally relevant software version 2.xx.xx.xxxx (metrological code in DPS700.dll, checksum-protected); alternatively the World View software (HeaderDisplay.dll Version 1.0.0.10, DPS710.dll Version 1.0.0.29), which permits use for direct sales to the public."
